    a: "L(C) = A · (C + B)<sup>−α</sup> + E, chosen so the error stays positive, falls monotonically and levels off at an irreducible error E. The fit is 2.38 · (C + e<sup>20.03</sup>)<sup>−0.0603</sup> + 0.00, with C in GFLOPs.",
